---
import electronIcon from "../../public/Electron-logo.svg";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
---

<h2>The Majewski Collection App</h2>
<p class='electron-logo'>
  Built with Electron
  <Image
    src={electronIcon}
    alt='Electron JS Logo'
  />
</p>

<section class='content-wrapper'>
  <div class='video-wrapper card-shadow'>
    <iframe
      width='560'
      height='315'
      src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/shg_eU2ng14?si=UoorxV5sqALCEok0'
      title='YouTube video player'
      referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin'
      allowfullscreen
    ></iframe>
  </div>
  <div class='text-wrapper form-shadow'>
    <p>
      This is the app that I use to interact with my music catalog database.
      This was the one..., the one that I took a moment when it was fully
      functional, sat back and enjoyed the fruits of my labor for all the time I
      spent learning how to write code.
    </p>
    <p>
      For now this is just a silly little teaser video. I am now in the process
      of storyboarding and getting ready to record the walkthrough demonstration
      video.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  h2 {
    margin-block-end: 1lh;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .electron-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding-inline-start: 0.25rem;

    img {
      width: 2rem;
      height: 2rem;
    }
  }

  .content-wrapper {
    --shadow-offset: 5px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;

    .text-wrapper {
      flex: 1 360px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 1lh;
      max-width: 47ch;
      margin-inline: auto;
      padding: 1rem;
      outline: 1px solid var(--text-color-700);
    }

    .video-wrapper {
      flex: 1 500px;
      margin-inline: auto;
      max-width: 500px;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;

      iframe {
        border: none;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
      }
    }
  }
</style>
